  m_text: "Dursty is a desert planet with extreme temperature shifts, ranging from
    24\u201367\xB0C by day to -20\xB0C at night. The atmosphere contains oxygen but
    is dense with dust, requiring respirators. Frequent sandstorms and intense solar
    radiation make survival difficult.\n\n"
